---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import personalImage from "../assets/images/me.webp";
---

<article
  class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-8 text-gray-300 md:flex-row"
>
  <div
    class="order-2 text-pretty [&>p]:mb-4 [&>p>strong]:text-primary md:order-1"
  >
    <p>
      Senior Full-Stack, AI &amp; Workflow Automation Engineer working directly with stakeholders,
      from discovery and architecture to implementation and operations. I design systems where
      typed code, queues and AI agents replace manual work and legacy tools, backed by tests and CI/CD gates.
    </p>

    <p>
      EU citizen · GCP Associate Cloud Engineer · MBA in Software Engineering (USP)
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Workflow &amp; Automation:</strong> n8n (Self-Hosted, Queue Mode, External Task Runners), Puppeteer, Playwright, pg-boss, Microsoft Graph/SharePoint, Gotenberg PDF, ExcelJS and UiPath migration<br />
      <strong>Applied AI:</strong> Claude API, Azure OpenAI, OpenAI SDK, MCP, tool calling,
      structured outputs, RAG, pgvector, Azure Speech STT/TTS, Translator and Video Indexer<br />
      <strong>Full-Stack &amp; Systems:</strong> TypeScript (Node.js, Bun, Hono, NestJS), Rust (Axum, Tokio, SQLx),
      SvelteKit, Vue/Nuxt, Astro, Turborepo, PostgreSQL, Meilisearch<br />
      <strong>Cloud, Security &amp; Infra:</strong> GCP (ACE), Azure, AWS, Oracle Cloud, Cloudflare,
      Docker Compose, Linux VMs, Azure DevOps, GitHub Actions, Better Auth, 2FA/RBAC and GDPR
    </p>
  </div>
  <Image
    src={personalImage}
    width={256}
    height={256}
    alt="Alexandre Spindola"
    class="order-1 aspect-square h-full w-64 rotate-3 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-500/5 p-1 object-cover ring-1 ring-white/20 md:order-2 lg:w-64 lg:p-2"
    style="object-position: 50% 50%"
  />
</article>
